VALUES ('sbu_tech_kb_v1_p3_c019', '| Portal / action | Instructions and limitations |', 3, '| Portal / action | Instructions and limitations |
| --- | --- |
| Client Portal | https://www.sbutech.com/login |
| Client login | Choose Login, enter the registered email address and password, then select Sign In as Client. The portal is described as providing access to active sprint boards, staging links and invoices. |
| New client registration | Choose Register on the Client Portal and follow the live form. If registration or approval is unclear, contact contact@sbutech.com. The public page does not publish a complete account-approval or password-reset guide. |
