VALUES ('sbu_tech_kb_v1_p3_c015', '7. Website portal & login guidance', 3, '7. Website portal & login guidance
Portal / action
Instructions and limitations
Client Portal
https://www.sbutech.com/login
Client login
Choose Login, enter the registered email address and password, then select Sign In as 
Client. The portal is described as providing access to active sprint boards, staging links and 
invoices.
New client registration
Choose Register on the Client Portal and follow the live form. If registration or approval is 
unclear, contact contact@sbutech.com. The public page does not publish a complete 
account-approval or password-reset guide.
Owner access
The supplied portal screenshot shows an Owner option. It is for authorised owners only. 
Never share or request owner credentials in the chatbot.
Admin Portal
https://www.sbutech.com/admin. The live page currently displays “Mock Admin Mode” 
and states that forms run in browser state with no live database connected. Do not present 
